1
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:04,650
Aaaaaaah!

2
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:13,370
Goddammit!

3
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:17,051
How could you let yourself give
in to the Synthesis ritual?

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,640
You forget why you're a swordsman?

5
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,371
Why you left Rulid and came
to Senator in the first place?

6
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:24,980
You're here for Alice!

7
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,869
You're here to take
her back home with you!

8
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,480
Far west

9
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,800
Haah!

10
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:44,550
Anima Ah!

11
00:00:44,633 --> 00:00:46,040
Ha! Ah!

12
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,470
Ah!

13
00:00:47,553 --> 00:00:48,383
Ah!

14
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:54,280
I'll see you later.

15
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:13,860
I'll be the best, I'll be the best

16
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:42,040
to cross swords for
real, to tell the truth.

17
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:45,540
I knew you'd beat me one
day, but that ain't today.

18
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:51,440
I'll show him a move he's
never seen me do before.

19
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:06,660
Burst element.

20
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:19,420
He is much too powerful.

21
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:22,057
I doubt this one is really your friend.

22
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,728
What are you talking about?

23
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:27,467
If he's been synthesized, wouldn't
that make him super strong?

24
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,340
That is true.

25
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:31,698
However, something is off about him.

26
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:37,220
For one who only just became an Integrity
Knight, he seems too accustomed to battle.

27
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,717
Incarnate arms and that
aerial element skill he just

28
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:44,212
used are far too advanced for
a newcomer to have mastered.

29
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:49,240
You should let me handle him.

30
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:52,320
I got this.

31
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:02,460
Alright, buddy.

32
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:05,157
When this is over, I'll give you a name.

33
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:07,640
Just help me get through this.

34
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,780
En Kirito, Ugeo!

35
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,400
A snappy move.

36
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:53,420
It got a name?

37
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:56,680
Blade style. Stormwave.

38
00:04:57,140 --> 00:04:58,300
Wait, Blade?

39
00:04:58,540 --> 00:05:00,517
As in Golgorosso, Blade?

40
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,540
Yu-Gi-Oh, think back.

41
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:06,095
Do you remember the guy that
taught you how to do that?

42
00:05:06,900 --> 00:05:08,857
I don't, and I don't care.

43
00:05:08,940 --> 00:05:11,420
The only person I need to remember is her.

44
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:14,000
She is the reason I use my sword.

45
00:05:14,300 --> 00:05:16,480
I exist to eliminate her enemies.

46
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:22,920
He's got a crystal in his head,
just like Eldrie and Alice.

47
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:28,320
Once the Piety Module is inserted, it
effectively blocks the links to memories.

48
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:33,260
With that, the prospective knight's
past is sealed away. The result?

49
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:37,980
A knight who is loyal to the church
and to their creator, the Pontifex.

50
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,620
What memories are being blocked?

51
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:44,860
If I can figure it out and
remind him, he'll snap out of it.

52
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:49,140
No, it'll take more than words
to break Administrator's spell.

53
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:52,900
I'll pour my heart into my sword.

54
00:05:53,140 --> 00:05:54,199
That'll reach him!

55
00:05:54,460 --> 00:05:55,800
Hell, it's better!

56
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,940
Q-G-R!

57
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:08,060
I'm gonna force you to remember
everyone you cared about!

58
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:10,517
Back in Real, there's
a girl waiting for you!

59
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,600
Her name's Selka!

60
00:06:12,220 --> 00:06:16,455
At the Swordcraft Academy, Bulbarossa
was your mentor and Lina was mine!

61
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:19,619
And Tiese and Ronier,
remember when we last saw him?

62
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:20,860
Come on, man!

63
00:06:21,260 --> 00:06:23,436
You gotta remember why you came here!

64
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:25,480
It's to take Alice back home!

65
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,700
Remember, damn it!

66
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,060
Yu-Gi-Oh!

67
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,940
Alice.

68
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,800
Do you remember her?

69
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:36,060
Yu-Gi-Oh.

70
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,630
Watch out!

71
00:07:43,340 --> 00:07:44,800
Enhance armament.

72
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:59,980
Yucho, why?

73
00:08:32,060 --> 00:08:37,160
I trust you took care of those
despicable traitors, Number 32.

74
00:08:37,860 --> 00:08:41,000
I have them both trapped
in ice, Prime Senator, sir.

75
00:08:41,300 --> 00:08:42,653
They can't go anywhere.

76
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:43,960
You don't say!

77
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,301
That's all well and good, my boy.

78
00:08:46,420 --> 00:08:49,240
But you did not finish them off, did you?

79
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:53,060
No, Prime Senator, I did not.

80
00:08:53,620 --> 00:08:57,855
My orders from the Pontifex were to
stop the traitors, not to kill them.

81
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:58,940
That won't do!

82
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:00,580
That simply won't do!

83
00:09:00,860 --> 00:09:04,240
And when you speak to me,
you'll call me Your Excellency!

84
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:07,020
Do not forget that again, Number 32,

85
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:11,640
because if you do, I will punish
you by turning you into a horse.

86
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:16,640
And then I shall ride on your back,
shouting, Giddy up, little horsey! Giddy up!

87
00:09:19,020 --> 00:09:22,960
I'll finish them off, and show
her eminence who's more loyal.

88
00:09:35,700 --> 00:09:37,600
I have returned, my lady.

89
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,560
Welcome back, Eugeo.

90
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:44,880
Did you complete the task I gave you? Yes.

91
00:09:45,540 --> 00:09:46,640
Well done.

92
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,520
You deserve a reward.

93
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:50,646
Come, climb into bed with me.

94
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,480
All right.

95
00:09:59,820 --> 00:10:03,400
As promised, I shall give
you your heart's desire.

96
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:07,680
Love for you, and you alone.

97
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,190
Yes.

98
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:14,220
First, I should do
something about that wound.

99
00:10:18,980 --> 00:10:25,717
Now then let me have a look at
your face again I found an odd

100
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:30,057
gap in your memory and that is
where I put the module convenient

101
00:10:30,140 --> 00:10:34,477
but I should not have rushed
the process I'll resynthesize

102
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:38,540
you properly and then after
that you shall have your reward

103
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:08,500
The End

104
00:11:10,660 --> 00:11:13,040
Be a good boy and stay still.

105
00:11:18,100 --> 00:11:21,600
This module is a vast
improvement over the old ones.

106
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:27,460
It bolsters the imagination and unlocks
advanced arts like incarnate arms.

107
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:33,920
Now relax and show me your memories again.

108
00:11:34,180 --> 00:11:38,340
And this time, I'll insert it into
the memory you hold most dear.

109
00:11:39,100 --> 00:11:41,740
You can't move, but you may speak.

110
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,240
Now, chant the spell I taught you.

111
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,740
Go on.

112
00:11:46,260 --> 00:11:48,731
Don't tell me you've forgotten it already.

113
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:50,240
Oh, you silly thing.

114
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:53,560
Remove core protection.

115
00:12:08,500 --> 00:12:09,540
How dare you!

116
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:45,980
I see you regained your senses.

117
00:12:46,380 --> 00:12:48,145
I can't believe you fooled me.

118
00:12:50,860 --> 00:12:54,920
I assume the little brat from the
library gave you that knife, yes?

119
00:12:56,540 --> 00:12:58,000
Stab me all you want.

120
00:12:58,220 --> 00:12:59,840
I am impervious to it.

121
00:13:00,260 --> 00:13:02,600
No metal object can pierce my skin.

122
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:05,020
You poor child.

123
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:07,277
To reject the promise I made.

124
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:12,220
All you had to do was give yourself to
me, and I would love you back in return.

125
00:13:12,660 --> 00:13:15,980
The kind of love you sought
all your life. Eternal love.

126
00:13:16,180 --> 00:13:17,200
Eternal control.

127
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:20,380
And you chose to reject it like this.

128
00:13:22,700 --> 00:13:23,900
Eternal love.

129
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:28,060
Eternal control.

130
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,880
That's right, Eugeo.

131
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,840
If you give yourself to me,

132
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:35,477
that thirst you've been suffering
from would be instantly quenched.

133
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:40,120
and all the confusion and fear you
harbored for so long would disappear.

134
00:13:41,220 --> 00:13:43,740
But I shall give you one more chance.

135
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:46,600
Take your sword and smash that toy.

136
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:52,440
Do that, and I shall forgive your sins
and shower you with the bounty of my love.

137
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:58,440
To love is to control
and to be controlled.

138
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:04,332
If that is how you think of
it, then I feel sorry for you.

139
00:14:05,860 --> 00:14:12,360
Maybe that's how you feel, starved for
love, looking all over and never finding it.

140
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:15,380
But love isn't about control,

141
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:18,972
and you don't give it to get
something like a transaction.

142
00:14:19,300 --> 00:14:23,100
You give it selflessly, like
you give water to a flower.

143
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:25,540
That's love, real honest love.

144
00:14:27,820 --> 00:14:29,020
What a shame.

145
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:33,057
I wanted to forgive you for your
treasonous acts against the church.

146
00:14:33,140 --> 00:14:38,180
I wanted to save your soul, and
this is how you speak to me.

147
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:47,140
I could drain your life and turn
you into a jewel if I wanted,

148
00:14:47,420 --> 00:14:48,949
but that would be a waste.

149
00:14:49,100 --> 00:14:52,620
Instead, I'll synthesize
you by force, like her.

150
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:53,630
You mean...

151
00:14:53,713 --> 00:14:57,977
That's right, sweet number 30,
the one you're so infatuated with.

152
00:14:58,060 --> 00:15:01,577
She also refused to chant the
spell and it took the automated

153
00:15:01,660 --> 00:15:05,880
senators days to disable her
core protection You monsters.

154
00:15:06,260 --> 00:15:07,880
I didn't actually see it.

155
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:08,920
I was asleep

156
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:14,357
I'm sure it was agonizing for her.

157
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:19,060
Oh Well in the end you too
will suffer the same experience

158
00:15:28,060 --> 00:15:32,680
I WILL BREAK THROUGH!

159
00:16:03,860 --> 00:16:05,160
That sword.

160
00:16:06,220 --> 00:16:08,740
Oh, now I see.

161
00:16:13,140 --> 00:16:14,400
Save me!

162
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:18,500
Please, your eminence!

163
00:16:18,620 --> 00:16:20,120
I need assistance here!

164
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,140
You traitor!

165
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:25,797
This little bastard
betrayed you, your eminence!

166
00:16:25,880 --> 00:16:30,140
He said he trapped Number 30 and that
other rogue, but he didn't even...

167
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:33,260
Let go! Let go!

168
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:47,970
Kirito...

169
00:16:54,920 --> 00:16:56,400
What's up? Yu-Gi-Oh.

170
00:17:05,320 --> 00:17:06,150
Sorry.

171
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:09,140
I gave in to Administrator's temptation

172
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:11,360
and tried to kill you both.

173
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:14,920
I wanted to sacrifice
myself to atone for it.

174
00:17:15,100 --> 00:17:16,857
I knew that's what you were going for.

175
00:17:16,940 --> 00:17:20,175
We've been friends so long,
I can read you like a book.

176
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:23,580
You never change, do you?

177
00:17:27,780 --> 00:17:28,610
Alice.

178
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:45,660
Is that her? Administrator?

179
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:48,070
Yes.

180
00:17:48,153 --> 00:17:51,040
She looks the same as
she did six years ago.

181
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:55,420
Bercouli and Fanatio were just
about due for me to reset them.

182
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:59,700
But you, Alice, I've only had
you for what, six years now?

183
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:03,097
Your logic circuits don't
seem to be malfunctioning.

184
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:07,100
Perhaps that irregular unit
is influencing you. Hmm.

185
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,340
What is it, Alice?

186
00:18:10,620 --> 00:18:13,637
If you wish to say something
to me, then just say it.

187
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:15,080
I won't get mad.

188
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:17,340
Please, speak your mind.

189
00:18:29,940 --> 00:18:31,540
I will, your eminence.

190
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:36,320
As of today, the proud order of
the Integrity Knights has fallen.

191
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:40,877
All it took to bring it down
were the swords of the two

192
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:44,840
rebels at my side and the
obsession and deceit of your rule,

193
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:47,140
represented by this cathedral.

194
00:18:47,700 --> 00:18:50,220
My duty is not to protect the church,

195
00:18:50,500 --> 00:18:53,557
but to protect the innocent
and safeguard their peace.

196
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:57,300
It is your actions,
more than anything else,

197
00:18:57,620 --> 00:19:01,502
which threaten the well-being of
the citizens of the human empire.

198
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,310
You!

199
00:19:04,420 --> 00:19:05,840
Shut your mouth!

200
00:19:06,180 --> 00:19:07,180
How dare I?

201
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,920
Duty, you say, you broken toy? Ha!

202
00:19:10,380 --> 00:19:14,237
You knights are nothing more than dolls,
and you're guilty as you put it...

203
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:15,150
Fascinating.

204
00:19:15,560 --> 00:19:18,440
It isn't a logic circuit error after all.

205
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:21,760
And her piety module is still functioning.

206
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:26,057
Which means she must have
disabled the code 871

207
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:29,140
that was installed for
me by her own volition,

208
00:19:29,440 --> 00:19:31,380
rather than by sudden emotion.

209
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:35,320
That thing in her eyes called code 871?

210
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:39,140
I won't know how it happened
until I run an analysis.

211
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:42,580
Now then, Chudelkin.

212
00:19:43,540 --> 00:19:44,960
Since I am generous,

213
00:19:45,280 --> 00:19:48,337
I shall give you the chance to
restore your tattered reputation.

214
00:19:48,420 --> 00:19:51,800
Use your sacred arts and
deal with those three.

215
00:19:55,420 --> 00:19:56,820
But your eminence!

216
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:58,320
Your gloriousness!

217
00:19:58,740 --> 00:20:00,060
Yes, what is it?

218
00:20:02,120 --> 00:20:06,580
For the first and only time in
my many years of service to you,

219
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:10,137
I would like to present you
with a most impudent request.

220
00:20:10,220 --> 00:20:13,517
I shall happily risk my life
annihilating these traitors.

221
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:16,477
However, once I have fulfilled
your wishes, would you?

222
00:20:16,560 --> 00:20:21,637
Would you let me touch
your exalted body and kiss

223
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:25,020
your lips and spend one
magical night alone with you?

224
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:26,980
Please, please!

225
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:31,140
I would be most grateful if
you granted me such a delight!

226
00:20:35,340 --> 00:20:37,200
Very well, Chudelkin.

227
00:20:37,800 --> 00:20:40,180
I swear to the goddess Stacia,

228
00:20:40,420 --> 00:20:42,657
as soon as you have
fulfilled your mission,

229
00:20:42,740 --> 00:20:48,140
My body will be yours for the
taking every inch for one night.

230
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:55,400
Words cannot express the joy you've
brought me, your exalted holiness.

231
00:20:56,160 --> 00:21:00,420
And I swear to you, I will
not let you down. Huh?

232
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:03,040
I am resolute and energized.

233
00:21:03,340 --> 00:21:06,677
I am motivated and I am invincible!

234
00:21:06,760 --> 00:21:11,940
Thermal System Call!

235
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:18,300
Generate Thermal Element!

236
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:32,957
Now I will show you my
greatest secret art!

237
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:39,400
Come forth, genie, and
burn these traitors to ash!

238
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:44,040
Thank you.

239
00:23:11,393 --> 00:23:13,817
And everything turns to dust to dust

240
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:38,560
Next time Titan of the Sword
